        "true": [
          {
            "id": "a1d6f6a1-8d25-462a-a966-b62583cfe8e2",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "430a5316-0662-49ec-ab96-0fe31a21a5e4",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "d5ed5ac1-6e85-455e-a3f0-378e499a843a",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "The old route\njoins Frostwick\nDepot, Candy\nSorting,\nBrassworks",
                      "Control, Velvet\nLodge, and Aurora\nSignal. The\nnorthern roof line",
                      "reaches couriers\nquickly. The\nsouthern sheltered\nline keeps parcels",
                      "dry. Both are\npublic routes,\ndespite the newer\nmap."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "76567ffd-03ba-4724-abad-751ccccfd695",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0c0e72dc-7a48-4bfa-ad83-d8a80eb9e548",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "d170d9d9-f0b7-456c-acf3-33cd6737ea6b",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "c49a0e6e-d147-4187-ab35-e19432c07403",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "8f0ce519-665a-42fb-add4-58a426960ec5",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Moxie has six\nsmall parcels for\nthe first round.\nHer roof harness",
                      "carries three at a\ntime; the covered\nhandcart carries\nall six. The",
                      "high line is\nchecked in two\ntrips, and the\ncovered line in\none.",
                      "Neither route has\na timer. The\nclinic wants a\ncomplete delivery",
                      "record, not a\nspeed boast. Moxie\nasks how many\ntrips the larger\ncart",
                      "saves on this\nround."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cbd74794-e7f4-4ba5-a0d5-3a1c6c2bd3ee",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cc06a4a2-b6bb-4415-a9b7-5f9dcf94085c",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "9d95e53c-dd5f-4f1a-adae-4327fd3abb1c",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "a977dddf-f554-40e4-a61a-dce62fa0b6ca",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "88e7f55e-dfba-4ed6-ab4f-001117bbd982",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Moxie: I can take\nthe high line.\nThree turns,\nexcellent view,",
                      "terrible hat\ninsurance. The\ncovered route\nserves the clinic.\nIt is",
                      "longer but gives\nme someone to talk\nto besides weather\nvanes. Pick a",
                      "promise we can\nkeep."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "71b753b3-d5a0-47ff-aae9-d7472253b621",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f1243db8-692e-4d1a-acee-db0b3b03ef5f",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "3077d935-ad8f-4d5b-aa34-fdd24a80bf5d",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "d8faa812-756e-44fa-af1f-7b0cae230252",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "c710a1fc-9d73-4c64-acbb-6cc100105df4",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "The vane bears two\nservice marks:\nHIGH for the roof\ncircuit, COVER",
                      "for the sheltered\nclinic circuit.\nThis sets your\ndelivery plan.\nBoth",
                      "routes stay\nwalkable, and the\ncity will remember\nwhich promise you",
                      "made."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "4b833780-ef58-45e7-abf9-235e457541e8",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "71d8f915-7072-4851-a1c2-acbe3b5e14eb",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "22a07097-fa57-4804-a130-bea6cc23678d",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "39c9b74c-0b20-4055-aa80-b98b7097109f",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "c1724c1f-ea19-43eb-a9ce-34a179c3dd31",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Use the capacity\ncard to compare\nthe six-parcel\nload. How many\nfewer",
                      "trips does the\ncovered handcart\nneed than the roof\nharness? Your",
                      "route choice\nremains valid\neither way: the\nanswer tells Moxie\nhow to",
                      "staff it. A roof\nroute can make two\nhonest trips\nrather than claim",
                      "an overloaded\nharness is somehow\nmore festive."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "11caf1ce-bfee-42b5-a7c5-ae70d75210d2",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
